<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Simplified Chinese (zh-rCN). Every translatable string in values/strings.xml
    has an entry here; the guard is TranslationCatalogTest, which also pins the
    format placeholders, so a translation that drops a %1$s fails the build
    rather than the screen that uses it.

    Only the app's own interface is translated. Logs, the visor's own output and
    the status text the network reports stay in English on purpose — see
    com.skycoin.skywire.core.AppLanguage.
-->
